<title>BELGIUM: Bank Degroof rates Koramic hold.</title>
<headline>Bank Degroof rates Koramic hold.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's Bank Degroof said on Wednesday it rated shares in Koramic Building Products, formerly Terca Bricks, a hold.</p>
<p>The rating was unchanged from the bank's last review of the firm in October.</p>
<p>But Bank Degroof warned that overoptimism for the company was inappropriate and put its price/earnings ratio forecast for 1998 at 11.1 against 14.4 this year.</p>
<p>Koramic shares last traded at 1,780 francs, up five from Tuesday's close, and setting a new year high.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
